data: {"type":"response.completed","sequence_number":1829,"response":{"id":"resp_05ead64b871aca2a016adb6568f5f4819185b26729fc2a2b3f","object":"response","created_at":1792763241,"completed_at":1792763256,"status":"completed","background":false,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"presence_penalty":0.0,"moderation":null,"model":"gpt-6-luna","access_programs":null,"previous_response_id":null,"instructions":"Complete the supplied mathematical task using only its explicit inputs and tools. Submit the requested JSON artifact through structured submit_draft (preferred) or the compatible submit_artifact wrapper. Tool feedback is real task feedback; do not invent a successful check. This is a Yui workflow stage. Read the relevant declared Yui rules, preserve the supplied proof route and exact allowed assumptions, and distinguish mathematical review from structural checks.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_05ead64b871aca2a016adb656cb0dc81918f92558b53db226d","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABq22VsJ6hTyu-yMcMQaM4e9-ptP39zEXdvrW1tsK2vtGGToeE0ecXd-1x4SYZUdOqOq89jEG4kzVYTDoBgDqLdY5hRPoo3-QmJY7VieSy1HKp0GUkQm7vM2WCfQVv4cgKr5VCIqQzVMrgYQDwhllWYc1FULRgAUO_uj27WGYSHNGkw-J3sC9sj08exp8uvgwIFodjvKSGnm0gZsSmyIoGfN2FzYgYQks7vkONDFEUNpvmsiL66GJsKoofuscyPJAna2WUfSd1ToAgobCivMGUCAZ37b-IpGhGEVkI4XUZEcvAlDZN-XY3fYjzSa_KMJRU7T8Hhfb7khskApYz5PwU2hlZWyvxZi58CoGc41K54XYyoLIHJ1spjnMvZZpAXFB2yUYz3HKf13IcEoC7i5siXHFXZ6jpACRbMikmT13vigSfqT8Qws8R8GgRB3MCIQgVBkpzSeKBDXQYtPQ1Rqf9ptaTk_9UYqwB2LXS7qpjPiLg7DPWcbHDwM_U1MTM8lkuKvLQ7dyGPeQiYaoH6v_NEOSODZmJGgNU7f3-TYgYq4cubNo1y9o4MgFrPfQ2elM4UPhbAqdFdZN6wZsQL_iRsOoemk65EnEnjm7gO-Di3AGYGiGlj_j7o_BMm06E1WntQEySZU89C_JOpmS9XX_KNXDsD1mlX3R5TIhyg80_1bb5U-4YPMZx-wGjlZ-s8mj527AGncEJuTrhjk_n84TX91J-R9gKgVnpwY2tAdtzSNJNEDV7H0aIwLPYkhZC1mUFDxPp2BTQIDNiJGmuOXinAslj-qqsYXSkQt4J-AxYd357SJjCder8Lq38Di1tnLzieehjFF2HFiyVXSgxRiAA0DjrKksGYUeDD1sxkryEfYnPVmLt7dVQwq4fLt7k-LXVvYJBw1IweWqJHldCcqR0vrRYhjtpsnv_fdbrnGdGt2oTZMgXDMv9-q9u-pM4h1P6F217sVkz3mGqjbkb5NnpjCVNWju5uW